; The one variable: `surface_material_override/1` on an ArrayMesh whose two surfaces share one
; blue material. Correct is blue left, amber right: a leak turns both amber, a drop leaves both
; blue, a wrong index swaps them. No other fixture sets surface_material_override/N, and this
; one leaves out `material_override` so the image has one variable.
